{"title":"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/3/633f97f6a39e45f38f3a3e6bcda6475c60ba5ded.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\ne y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" /> be two real numbers. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/8/ab8d1b44c6f1a674edf9a36c56c6b94fd8d88279.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,a_1,a_2,a_3,y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/f/c8f17b18ffe4b7a34946ad6404641be40ac333e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_1,x,b_2,b_3,y,b_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"120\" height=\"16\" /> be two arithmetic sequences.\n</p><p>Calculate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4061acf762e0ceb80f84e360e90793fbbae775.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b_4-b_3}{a_2-a_1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"58\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/6/44612d9d6ec37da7f4edd0f205d65cdac5954dc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> be the common difference in the first sequence and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/7/117778db99ba8932dc35128d085c2619f4f690a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> the common difference in the second sequence. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/c/52cd2ece5b938a054df7f5000e8c40d182228a06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_4=x+4d_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"96\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/0920bc875df8fe4851ab2542342d01b7e2e182e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_3=x+2d_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"96\" height=\"15\" />. In addition, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/5/135dc65d47d35bd0576257dc0612576da77c7d49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2=x+2d_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/4/9449f9307d165c86a0ecfa7bc90cf1349e4eb263.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=x+d_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" />. Consequently <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/a/f6adb3e8553a7181d025941bfbf918873626bf82.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{b_4-b_3}{a_2-a_1}=\\frac{x+4d_2-x-2d_2}{x+2d_1-x-d_1}\\]\" width=\"224\" height=\"40\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/b/f9ba01c9c204f0e5c1b152eb3e64ab78a36891ca.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{b_4-b_3}{a_2-a_1}=\\frac{2d_1}{d_2}\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"40\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cc2f09d5d26794d48bcf7f8b479d45c12e1e47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d_2=\\frac{y-x}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"85\" height=\"33\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/7/a3772728243a2da101383baf3c6d9e4f966ffccb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d_1=\\frac{y-x}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"37\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/3/223532cbb806331131db9bc4b81be79a09df66a1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2d_1}{d_2}=\\frac{\\frac{2y-2x}{3}}{\\frac{y-x}{4}}\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"48\" /> which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/b/d8b8ef4b82941c7cd0618a980160372af35eac4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\frac83}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"24\" height=\"48\" />.\n- Juno\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2018 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathcontest.unm.edu/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest\" title=\"UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest\"> All UNM-PNM Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018005602\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 136/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1821/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 106/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2978/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.200      1 Template:UNM-PNM_Math_Contest_box\n100.00%    8.200      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17130:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018005602 and revision id 153316. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}